  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/670/670-11.htm",
  "statuteText": "670:11 Recounts. –\n\nRecounts of village district elections shall be conducted in the same manner as in town elections as provided in RSA 669:30-669:35 except that the board of recount shall be composed of the village district clerk, moderator and commissioners, each of whom shall perform the duties of the corresponding officer in the town."
